Lemma u32_range : forall x, 0 <= u32 x < 2^32.
Proof. ltac2:(Rpl.RP.run_i (rplG ()) 0 "S;0|10;!1,30|500;!1,32!2'213!2'5,61!2'5,64%~R!2'7,636!2'7,61!1+C+0!1'U#1$x;R+0vd!3'1#14&__sat1;R!2'413%~R57&__sat0;R$Ha;R8$~R+8!3'913#2%Ha;R8%~R+8!2'7,64&__sat1;R!1#2vd!2,:+;!2'<,6157&__arith;R&__wit;R!1,=+>!1+?+>&__varmap;R!1,@+0!1+A+0&__ff;R!7,B9'D+E+E,F!4,G+0!2,H+0,6,I!3,J+0!2,H+01!1,K2,L!2'M9,F!4'N#1#3vv!2,:+O,P!3+Q+O!2'R#1#3,P!3'S+0,6#26#1!2+T!2'7,6:!2'5:4").
Qed.
