Lemma sh_same_unget : forall f, sh_same f (sh_unget f).
Proof. ltac2:(Rpl.RP.run_i (rplG ()) 0 "SI0!1+?+0!1'`W#1!1'`W#2!1'aG#2!1'`T#2!1'a3#2!1'`Z#2!1'`V#2!3+Q+0!1'`V37!2+T!3+Q+0!1'`Z368!2+T!3+Q+0!1'a3359!1'`T#1!3+Q022!1'a3#1!3+Q+O44!1'`Z#1!3+Q+055!1'`V#1!3+Q+O;;!3+Q+0==!3+Q+0??!3+Q+0AA!2+TDE!2+TCF!1'aG#1$f;R+`Svd!6'^301$l;R0!2+T!3+Q0#12!2+T!3+Q+O!1'`T34:!6'^3+O;$b;R+O!2+T<!2+T!3+Q+O#14:!6'^3+0=$z;R+0!2+T<!2+T>!2+T!3+Q+0#159!6'^3+0?$z;R+0!2+T<!2+T>!2+T@!2+T!3+Q+0#168!6'^3+0A$z;R+0!2+T<!2+T>!2+T@!2+T!3+Q+066!3+Q+0#17!4,`?!3+Q011!2+TBG!2,:01!4,`?BG!2,:+O;!4,`?CF!2,:+0=!4,`?DE!2,:+0?!2,:+0A!1'`VH!1'aI#1!1'`ZH!1'aS#1!1'a3H!1'aR#1!1'`TH!1'aL#1!1'`WH!1'aK#1!2'fJ#1H").
